{"title": "Eldritch Spear", "pageid": 18802, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eldritch_Spear", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Eldritch_Blast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp/300px-Eldritch_Blast.webp, /w/images/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp/300px-Eldritch_Blast.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Eldritch_Blast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Eldritch Spear</b> is a passive feature that gives users a range boost on their Eldritch Blast cantrip.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The range of your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eldritch Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Eldritch_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Blast\" title=\"Eldritch Blast\">Eldritch Blast</a> increases by half. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Delverdenn\" title=\"Delverdenn\">Delverdenn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 666/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2841/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1368/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 184/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643652/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.503      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   25.503      1 -total\n 36.71%    9.361      1 Template:SAI\n 34.24%    8.732      1 Template:Icon_link\n 32.93%    8.397      1 Template:Icon_text\n 28.90%    7.370      2 Template:Trim\n 24.89%    6.347      1 Template:Ifempty\n 13.55%    3.456      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 12.54%    3.197      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.01%    3.063      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18802-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211726 and revision id 191617. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}